If I remember rightly there are some zero values in the Estrogen data and when 
logs are taken you get infinite values - not good for plotting!

In the affylmGUI package, I ask whether you wish to log the values for this very 
reason as I used the Estrogen data as my example data. When not logging the 
values, the RNAdeg plot works, so your problem is data specific, not a problem 
with the R code.

